  "Items.RhinoSteak.Desc": "Despite the name, it doesn't come from any rhinoceros or a rhino-morph. We can guarantee you that no rhinoceros were harmed in the production of this food.\n\nDISCLAIMER: \"We are not responsible if you find yourself altered.\""
