  "Items.RhinoSteak.Slower": "[pg]You begin to feel that the size of your muscles is starting to slow you down."
  "Items.RhinoSteak.NumbSkin": "[pg]Your skin feels clammy and a little rubbery. You touch yourself experimentally and notice that you can barely feel the pressure from your fingertips. Consumed with curiosity, you punch yourself lightly in the arm; the most you feel is a dull throb!"
  "Items.RhinoSteak.Dumber": "[pg]You shake your head and struggle to gather your thoughts, feeling a bit slow."
  "Items.RhinoSteak.UnicornHorn": "[pg]You begin to feel an annoying tingling sensation at the top of your head. Reaching up to inspect it you find the <b>sharp nub of a horn protruding from the center of your forehead</b> and growing. Once it's complete you estimate it to be about six inches long."
  "Items.RhinoSteak.UnicornHornGrow": "[pg]You begin to feel an intense pinching sensation in your central horn as it pushes out, growing longer and larger. You reach up and find <b>it has developed its own cute little spiral,</b> you estimate it to be about a foot long, two inches thick and very sturdy, a very useful natural weapon."
  "Items.RhinoSteak.FinGone": "[pg]A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into your spine. After a moment the pain passes, though your fin is gone!"
  "Items.RhinoSteak.WingsGone": "[pg]A wave of tightness spreads through your back, and it feels as if someone is stabbing a dagger into each of your shoulder-blades. After a moment the pain passes, though your wings are gone!"
  "Items.RhinoSteak.Skin1": "[pg]"
  "Items.RhinoSteak.SkinPlain": "You feel an itchy sensation as your skin thickens, <b>becoming tough gray skin</b>."
